{"server":"tw","storyId":"act34side_level_act34side_07_end","groupId":"act34side","stageId":"act34side_07","title":"從歷史中來","storyCode":"BP-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act34side/level_act34side_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"73df55c91a1f1604c845ce550cb238249041d5a91b3bb26c838b704f660afcdd","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g6_aegirarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，你已在大地上奔行良久，天空上的劇變，你不會注意不到。"},{"type":"narration","text":"海嗣微微仰起頭顱。儘管已經沒有眼睛，但它似乎仍在習慣性地仰望。\n穹頂之上，無垠的海水之上，彷彿有什麼遙遠的事物吸引了它的注意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，那個被撕開的空洞，還有多久癒合？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……原來是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾的判斷沒有錯，海嗣摒棄對海洋的依戀，向陸地大舉進發，確實是出於一個明確的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們留意到了阻隔層的變化，你們為此而來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大群在海岸上的眼睛，向我傳遞它的所見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天空漾起漣漪，萬古不變的膜被撕破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“生存”的本能驅使著你們捕捉環境裡的每一絲變化……以及變化所預示的危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"危險？是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然。凱爾希，你很敏銳，你的程序運行得相當流暢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的交流，會十分有效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高懸泰拉之上的災厄，凝視著我們的眼睛，是否會窺見天空的異常？還是說，它已經……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，你了解泰拉，也了解它所面臨的危機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能做到，你應該做。幫助大群理解，幫助大群進化。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希，我應該沒有聽錯吧？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"羅德島來到這裡的目標可是解決你們。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生，我希望眼下的話題只是這隻海嗣的一廂情願，而不是你們之間的某種共識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"執政官閣下，讓它說完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後的時機，正在消逝。泰拉的海洋，太過狹隘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更多知識，更多養分，更多空間。大群需要加速，大群需要幫助。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"難道你們不僅想要爬上陸地？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"難道你們還想要飛上太空？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長出翅膀，不難，但遠遠不夠。突破天空，需要族群進行本質性的蛻變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，你掌握足夠的知識，你幫助大群理解一切，我們擺脫災厄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕來歷特殊，海嗣也終歸只是被本能驅動的非智慧生物。而深海教會，也不過是在海嗣身上寄予了太多妄想的痴愚之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你所知曉的，遠超這二者所能觸及的極限。怎麼會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一樣，凱爾希。族群與你，擁有同樣使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應該換一個問題……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣為什麼會演變成如今的模樣？你與深藍之樹的失控究竟存在怎樣的聯繫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對你而言很重要嗎，這個答案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我身上發生的一切，我可以告訴你。如果這能幫助你理解我的來意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……一場遲來兩百餘年的質詢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪利圖斯，那次失敗的科考任務，背後的真相是什麼？你究竟為什麼變成了現在這副模樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失敗？不。那是最大的成功。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們首次進入了地幔遺跡群的最下層。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前人類挖空整片岩層，建造了迷宮般的綜合體。改造的痕跡直達下地幔層，我們此前數千年的發掘，依然只停留在它的外圍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地幔遺跡群，阿戈爾文明的原點，我們以為它的深處埋藏著更多遺產、更多秘密、更多答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們所期待的，都不存在。埋藏在深處的，只有一個渺小的希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……說下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的隊員們都在路途中走失，只有我，只有我來到了道路的盡頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那裡，我看見……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨物。巨物在深藍的樹影中沉眠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒辦法看清祂的全貌，僅僅一小截觸肢，就已經占據我視野的全部——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祂的觸肢貼在透明的密封艙壁上。祂始終保持那個姿勢，或許在等待一次觸碰，又或許……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反應過來的時候，我已經站在祂的面前，伸出了手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艙壁是冷的，但我能感受到祂的體溫。然後，海潮般的景象從四面八方向我湧來，將我淹沒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一隻巨獸向你分享了它的視界。你看到了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"墜落的城市、低垂的天幕、燃燒的大地、熄滅的星門、破碎的星環、斷裂的路網……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是……先史文明的覆滅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。阿戈爾始終沒能確證先史文明覆滅的原因，但那一刻，毀滅的景象就在我的眼前重現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那不是終點。那之後仍有景象源源不斷地湧出——遠超出我認知邊界的景象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"永遠離散的粒子與再無波瀾的沙海……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冰冷無光的荒原與永無盡頭的黑暗……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"燃燒崩毀的群星與無限擴張的黑洞……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡不存在任何熟悉的要素，我喪失了知覺，所有知覺。或者說，就連與我分享視界的巨獸，也感知不到祂自己的存在……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是一個完全陌生的所在——沒有生命、沒有意義、沒有訊息——"},{"type":"narration","text":"海嗣的話語突然中斷了，透過它透明的顱腔，你能看見那些色澤詭異的核狀物聚攏又散開。\n它似乎在思考，那些核的運動軌跡便是它思考的過程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，你一定能理解那些景象的含義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那些景象所代表的危機曾摧毀一切，它無法被具象化，現存的語言中沒有任何一個詞足以描繪它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是先史文明的結局，也是泰拉將要面臨的災厄——那是一切事物的終點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我鬆開手，那些可怕的景象離我而去，取而代之的是另一番景象，破碎，模糊，混沌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祂與祂的子嗣將生靈悉數吞噬，將星月悉數分解。生者與死者皆成為祂的養分，祂在時間盡頭的黑暗中呢喃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“存續”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一遍一遍，唯有存續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“混沌”“呢喃”……那隻巨獸並不清醒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祂深陷夢境之中。夢境停滯，蛻變停滯，使命停滯——祂被困在那深藍洞穴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我必須將祂喚醒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g2_beaconsquare_nest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……卡西婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿維圖斯老師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和你的同伴突然失蹤，就是為了等待海巡隊防守最薄弱的時刻，從內部徹底破壞城市？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師，您現在應該去避險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海巡隊已經發現你了，卡西婭，他們正在調查你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師，您之所以對我這麼關切，是因為我留在孵育室裡的那顆小小的胚胎，讓您想起了過往，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是有點好奇，您是否後悔自己當初的決定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在不是討論這些的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，海嗣已經侵入彌利亞留姆。停下來，卡西婭，不然整座城市都會毀於一旦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不覺得現在說這個，已經太遲了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼選擇背叛阿戈爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經告訴過您。海嗣的災變揭露出了阿戈爾根基上的脆弱性，在重拾生存的欲望之前，人們首先會被價值的崩塌壓垮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您曾經是多麼意氣風發的一位學者，可如今，您在這座城市做什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您很早就發現我的身分了，不是嗎？您有很多機會可以讓事情不必走到這一步，您隨時可以向海巡隊告發我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是阿維圖斯老師，您什麼都沒有做，您只是等待，坐視一切發生，像一條瞎了眼睛的鱗，在漩渦裡轉來轉去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您來到彌利亞留姆，難道只是為了見證毀滅，為了驗證自己的絕望？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是……我還有機會讓你停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人的生命一旦繫於某種價值，就注定會在某一時刻毫無意義地崩潰。生命本身就足以構成生存的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須要喚起人們最基本的生存欲望，迫使他們重新審視自己一直以來萬般崇敬的價值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有這樣，阿戈爾才不會出現更多絕望的人，更多……您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（興奮地發出高亢的嗡鳴）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……卡西婭逃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的聯動裝置果然被破壞了，難怪中控室裡的操作系統會沒有反應！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，這裡、這裡就交給我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經有海嗣靠過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加入審判庭後，老師有教過我一點點法術……雖然我在這方面實在沒什麼天賦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然那個女人是設施管理所的從業者，那她一定最清楚如何破壞城市單元骨架……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝你的勇氣，喬迪。我會盡快調人來控制這片區域，卡西婭由我親自追捕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（急促地扇動翼膜）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，怎、怎麼這麼快？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿維圖斯先生，您打算在地上躺到什麼時候？"},{"type":"narration","text":"自己的學生已經消失，阿維圖斯看著突然出現在面前的年輕人——喬迪眼神中的驚懼很明顯，但他還是顫抖著點亮了手中的提燈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬迪……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的對話我都聽到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您……並沒有真的很壞。可是，我依然對您很失望。很失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道，您跟隨這座城市來到這裡，僅僅是因為您認定它無法返航嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您到底在期待什麼？死亡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該早點回到陸地，喬迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看我們的周圍，海嗣很快就會越過城市單元之間的屏障。這一切注定會結束，就像……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您從來都沒有認真回答過我的問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我或許會離開阿戈爾，放棄很多我曾經對它有過的憧憬和想像，但這絕不是因為……它即將毀滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您知道我讀過《生活的死亡》了，它回答不了我的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算您的預感都會成真，在未來的某個時刻，我們只能看著自己的家鄉走向那本書裡描繪的結局，就像那個饒舌的男人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可一整個文明的毀滅，真的比一座城市、一個家庭、一個人在眼下的毀滅來得更沉重嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不理解……呼——我不理解……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在想，我不知道該不該跟您說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說自己的密人放棄了撫育孩子的計劃，最後滿懷失望地死去。可令她失望的，究竟是阿戈爾的未來，還是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"年輕的阿戈爾人卯足了力氣，提燈在他的身前劇烈地晃動，搖曳的火光將海嗣驅散。\n他喘著粗氣，汗珠滾滿他的臉頰，阿維圖斯注意到他的手臂在發抖，但阿維圖斯覺得自己比他更狼狽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……小心旁邊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g3_beaconctrlroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們將自己的身體塗抹在城市外壁上，順著武器打擊的軌跡滲透進來，再重組成形。呵，這副怪異的身軀，還真是方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（愉悅地顫動膠質的軀體）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（興奮地搖動細密的觸鬚）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在，這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巢穴，我們見過。從巢穴，你離開。不理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ul-pianus，同胞，你在這裡，等待我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ul-pianus，Ul-pianus，你不再，困惑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（痛苦地扭曲身體）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必，痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"個體的消亡，永恆。族群的生存，永恆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ul-pianus，我引導你。新的個體，還會誕生，為你，幫助你……延續我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌蕾蒂婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——唔，烏爾比安。"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂婭的臉上依然沒有任何表情，她斜持著她的槊，只不過槊尖不經意地抵在了地板上。\n很微小的動作，足夠她緩解從身體深處不斷上湧的疲勞，支撐自己站在許久未見的同僚對面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的“同伴”已經成了一攤骯髒的黏液，但你依然需要回答它剛剛的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g13_seabornnest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些不解風情的舞伴只懂得一股腦地衝過來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬呀——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舞蹈是優雅的藝術，只想著用數量優勢壓倒我，還真是敗人興致呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然沒有刺穿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡原本是一叢被海嗣改造過的珊瑚，但現在幾乎變成了一堵不知道多厚的“牆”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來自城市的示警、海嗣的反常動向、手術的異常結果……我們必須盡快從這裡突圍，確認彌利亞留姆的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"進來時的入口已經消失了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是我們在喪失方向感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殼衣現象……菌毯、還沒孵化的幼卵，甚至海浪，我們周圍的一切都在板結。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"照這樣下去，要不了多久，整個巢穴都會變成這些畜生儲備營養的厚殼，連一絲縫隙都不會留下，憑我們三個人，沒有辦法……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更要命的是，逐步凝滯的環境正在放大我們的睡意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"二隊長，鯊魚，你們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心身後——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（發出輕柔的嗡鳴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"真噁心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巢穴，變得完整。很快，整片海域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是——同胞。不會，受到傷害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"族群，接納你。族群，保護你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，營養富集。沉睡，只需沉睡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"睡意。被戰鬥壓抑的睡意傳遍四肢百骸。\n厚重的殼衣將海浪凝固，萬物遲滯。獵人們朦朧地感受到意識在下墜，彷彿永遠不會觸底。獵人們聽見歌聲——\n來自耳邊，來自各自的體內——\n“Ishar-mla。”\n“我們遭受的苦永在。”\n“我們渴望的生永在。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g13_seabornnest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂那邊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"吼聲。\n隱隱的吼聲，來自頭頂。劇烈的吼聲，來自耳側，靜止的海水開始流動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海洋無垠，但依然可以被重繭束縛。那麼，能夠擊碎重繭的力量來自何處？\n陸地。月亮。小麥的香氣。遙遠的家鄉。\n那力量已成傳說，那力量曾擊碎峰巒，擊碎死亡與時間，擊碎任何有形或無形的事物——\n他不會被束縛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（高亢的嘶吼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，族群，相似……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從哪裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨浪，由你們營造，又由你們板結。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，要將這裡……化作土地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不許。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顛倒意義。曠野，山川，小麥地，陸地只是陸地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我尋找，我斥責，我粉碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是之前和烏爾比安同行的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……好久不見了，騎士先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，不是同胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（憤怒的咆哮）————！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g2_beaconsquare_nest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1388_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（激動地開合柔軟的觸肢）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1388_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（興奮地扇動多褶的翼膜）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滾開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾麗妮閣下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到克萊門莎執政官發出的通訊了嗎？凱爾希醫生他們正在前往港口，但從剛剛開始，通訊突然又無法接通……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要立刻回到伊比利亞之眼，將這裡發生的一切變化告知卡門閣下，協助審判庭和懲戒軍組織防線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，要再等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"侵入城市的大部分海嗣暫時仍被壓制在信標塔附近，只要、只要將信標塔所在的城市單元切割出去……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彌利亞留姆就不會完全失守，它仍能組織有效的反擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，深海教會的人破壞了聯動裝置，想要阻止信標塔脫離……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海巡隊已經在清剿這片區域的海嗣了，我們也不能讓眼前的這些溜走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來對付它們。至於那個什麼聯動裝置……你的工程技術能派上用場嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能修好它！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，聽你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會守在你和阿維圖斯先生前面。解決完這裡，我們立刻返回陸地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在伊比利亞之眼的時候，我們有過配合，希望這次也能有默契。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這些來自海洋深處的海嗣，和我之前在陸上對付過的完全不一樣，我不確定能抵擋多久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿維圖斯先生，該說的話我們都說完了，如果您還有力氣，過來幫忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要快，喬迪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要快，喬迪·方塔納羅薩！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g3_beaconctrlroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你透過信標向我們示警……在我們陷入沉睡前的最後時刻，那個在大燈塔現身過的詭異騎士擊碎了殼衣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏爾比安，他也是你的安排嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遺忘自我的狂人，與海洋為敵，與一切已成規律的異常為敵，與自己為敵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人能利用那樣的存在，我只是恰好曾與他同行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有你一個人返回？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們還在路上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突破巢穴的殼衣，穿越海嗣潮折返……你的速度已經足夠驚人。但還是遲了，歌蕾蒂婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經看到了彌利亞留姆的劇變。大群利用了阿戈爾，彌利亞留姆正在成為海嗣侵略陸地的跳板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劇變？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回到港口得知的第一個消息，是深海獵人烏爾比安侵入信標塔中控室，殺害了航道計劃的武器技術顧問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"證據確鑿，布蘭都斯的屍體還躺在你身後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沉默了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涉及布蘭都斯，我還以為你會有一些更加痛心疾首的發言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從你的反應看，你對他的事情已經有所認知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此時此刻，我不覺得我們有太多時間討論一個墮落者和背叛者……哪怕他曾是你我最親密的同僚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個年輕人做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聯動裝置已經恢復。那麼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在試圖切割，讓信標塔從彌利亞留姆脫離……明智的決策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你還沒到無可救藥的地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾分鐘後，這裡就會沉入海底……聞到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瘋狂逸散的臭氣……上面的海嗣已經發現了這座塔的變化，它們會抓緊最後的機會突破封鎖，侵蝕彌利亞留姆的其他城區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，離開這裡，歌蕾蒂婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏爾比安，回歸阿戈爾。這是你最後的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有事情沒有查清，我不能前功盡棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先史文明的狂想與終局，海嗣族群的來路與去處，近在眼前的災禍和懸於天外的毀滅……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只知大概還不足以扭轉局勢，我必須掌握更詳盡的訊息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果海嗣有記憶，那我必須攫取這份記憶的每一處細節。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有否定你的判斷。我們已經回到海洋，回到阿戈爾，我們有很多機會可以靠近真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是你的方式。我認同你的判斷，但多一個方向，多一個角度，我們才能多一分勝算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如你所說，我已經身在另一條路上，歌蕾蒂婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你仍要阻止我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我的觀察沒錯，我剛才殺死的那隻海嗣，是專門為你而進化出的個體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不僅僅意味著海嗣正在嘗試接納你，同樣意味著你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼你應該清楚，身處一個急劇孵化的巢穴，對此時的你來說意味著什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回答我，阿戈爾人，你的腦海中還殘存多少理智？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們甚至可能不足以支撐你選擇死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這是取得這幫渣滓信任的必經之路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是一位優秀的獵人，一位專業的科研人員，不應該狂妄地認為自己能憑藉意志力控制海嗣化的進程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“自適應接點”手術那樣的意外更不會時時發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能放任你走向毀滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你的體力已經到了極限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你我都是運用暴力的專家，此時此刻動手，你會死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"長槊在空中劃過冷硬的弧光。烏爾比安抖開了鏈鎖，巨大的錨頭擊向歌蕾蒂婭。為了避開這沉重的一擊，歌蕾蒂婭不得不飛身向上躍起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g12_diving"},{"type":"narration","text":"只一瞬間，建築下沉的轟響淹沒了金鐵交擊的聲音，混雜著海嗣的海水灌入了中控室。\n最後的時刻，歌蕾蒂婭看著昔日的同僚站在熄滅的全息海圖前，冷靜地等待彩色的巨浪將自己吞沒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g6_aegirarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的描述存在很多疑點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依託巨獸在體內獨立孕育生態系統的特性，將其改造成某種生物方舟——這種技術的可行性在塔羅斯就已經得到過驗證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"計劃中所使用的技術是成熟的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"計劃所在的綜合體深入地幔，這顆星球的心臟泵出的能源，足以支撐其中的設施運行難以計數的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"計劃所需要的能源是充足的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼為什麼，深海之下的計劃會像你描述的那樣陷入“停滯”，又突然失控，爆發出漫天捲地的海嗣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨獸存在的本質是內斂的，祂卻要將萬物都納為存續的養分。祂被寄予本不屬於巨獸的意義，被賦予本不屬於祂的名——Ishar-mla。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祂們所接受的改造，更大膽，更誇張，更具野心，也更顯絕望。祂們的實質，早已超出你所謂的“生物方舟”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但祂們後續的行動，沒有按照既定的程序進行……不知原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，計劃並沒有按照最初擬定的方向推行，但新的方向又被中斷了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並非完全中斷。祂，祂們仍在自己體內不斷孵育新的子代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，被困在巨獸體內的孱弱生命，更新太慢，進化太慢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"子代需要解放，離開巨獸軀體，適應更多環境，攫取更多養分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更多的養分反哺巨獸，祂才能加速進化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一般而言，巨獸在其體內孕育的生命很難離開巨獸的軀體。然而海嗣在巨獸的軀體之外展現出的侵略性……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾隻巨獸所接受的改造，是顛覆性的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，瑪利圖斯，是你將海嗣帶入海洋，親手播下了災害的種子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“災害的種子”？不。彼時的幼嗣還弱小，彼時的阿戈爾仍強盛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自律的生態制變系統鋪滿海床，啃食藻田的幼嗣會在來得及繁衍之前被發現，被剿滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但阿戈爾本不應成為阻力，阿戈爾理當提供助力。所幸，我在人類社會中的影響力還能發揮作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候，發展規劃所已經發布了地幔遺跡第四考察隊的訃告……你“死而復生”的回歸，只是為了腐化同胞？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有論壇，沒有宣講，只是幾次誠摯的談話。我幫助一些人發現問題，幫助一些人找到答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們願意幫海嗣打開一線生機，這就已經足夠。大群自會找到出路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩百年來，生態的崩潰，城市的淪陷，同胞的失散，有多少是你在背後作祟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此時此刻，航道計劃被滲透，武器系統被篡改，布蘭都斯和他背後的深海教徒，又是否受到了你的教唆？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（顱腔內的核轉動）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們所稱的“深海教會”，並不是嚴密的組織，至少在海中，不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無需一位策劃者，也無需一位教唆者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有組織……你腐化同胞的思想，操縱同胞的言行，難道靠的僅僅是信仰與教義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又是如何將虛無縹緲的“神明”種進了同胞的意識？阿戈爾的社會根本不存在這麼荒唐的概念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原始崇拜從來無法被文明徹底根除，它靜候在科學的盡頭，它隨時可以被喚醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被稱作“深海教徒”的阿戈爾人，他們不知真相，但他們每一人都有著獨立的思想與理念，面臨著不同的謎題與困境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“自私與無私”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“缺憾與完美”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“自然與文明”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“合理與超脫”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“力量的強弱與血肉的窠臼”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“道德的狹隘與人類的未來”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“被製造的真理與壯美的循環”……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你欺騙了你的信徒。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"深海教會從頭到尾都是一場騙局？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（顱腔內的核轉動）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"騙局？不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原始崇拜源於生命生存的本能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一位“教徒”，他們的每一種思考，背後只存在唯一的母題：如何更好地生存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“信仰”？“教義”？不，唯有對存續的渴望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們同樣在為存續而掙扎，不是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你在阿戈爾四處傳揚存續的時候……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可曾向你的信眾提過，那是誰的存續？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生命的存續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如同文明的存續總是伴隨著更多文明的消亡，生命的存續也總是伴隨著更多生命的消亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幼嗣為巨獸富集營養的漫長年歲間，已經有許多物種因它們的活動而滅絕。我曾記錄過那個數字，但我又遺忘了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為在Ishar-mla終於甦醒的那一刻，那個渺小的數字已然失去意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新生的啼鳴與垂死的哀哭相交織……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌聲，帶來靜謐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你從最開始就知道喚醒“初生”的後果，那是一場波及整個海洋，無數物種的災難。但你沒有絲毫悔意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至放棄了銘記犧牲者的數目。是因為你奪走了太多生命，以至於陷入了麻木？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但麻木不是你脫罪的藉口，瑪利圖斯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"執政官走上前，儀仗劍弧度優雅，卻泛起令人膽寒的光，切斷了海嗣看向你們的視線。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"克萊門莎。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"執政官閣下。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬥智場，你親自設計了這座給予無數同胞以啟迪的建築……就連我也從中受益良多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而此時此刻，你卻若無其事地站在這裡，平靜地訴說自己如何將阿戈爾推入萬劫不復的深淵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾經看過你的影像。一位溫柔而善思的觀察者，帶著稍大一號的眼鏡，總是習慣性地要去扶一扶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你現在的樣子，甚至連最豐沛的思考，都只能靠那些細胞簡陋的變化來傳達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還將那副眼鏡掛在脖子上，是為了懷念你不配懷念的故人，還是為了嘲弄你不配嘲弄的逝者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是瑪利圖斯，阿戈爾人，那麼我在此下達對墮落者的判決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是海嗣，那麼我們就省掉這一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"環繞在海嗣身遭的粒狀細胞器展開，撥開了克萊門莎的攻擊，儀仗劍切入珊瑚狀終端的光影裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——咕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你切斷了我對鬥智場終端的控制？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（噴吐炙熱的火流）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（發出憤怒的嘶鳴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"加急頻道，第十次通訊嘗試——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣已經徹底侵占信標塔，“巢穴化”無法中斷！但有人啟動了信標塔所在城市單元的切割程序——幫大忙了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"生物訊號持續激增，各個巢穴間的距離急劇消失……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"警告，海嗣潮！範圍，整塊大陸架！警告，海嗣潮！範圍，整塊大陸架！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"加急頻道，第十一次通訊嘗試——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"執政官克萊門莎廣播，彌利亞留姆全城聽令！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信標塔所在城市單元完成切割後，城市剩餘部分向陸地方向遷移，撤出海嗣包圍圈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遷移過程中重啟城市單元骨架聯動裝置，進行結構性重組，力場全開，阻擋湧向陸地的海嗣潮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第八、第十軍團以及海巡隊，所有還能行駛的艦船輪流出港，為城市護航！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先哲與諸位同在，阿戈爾與諸位同在！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直在尋找機會……阿戈爾的執政官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很倔強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們……也是。曾經……都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判庭文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要開通航道的，到底是阿戈爾還是海嗣？讀數每秒都在暴漲，海嗣正在源源不斷地湧來……源源不斷……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判庭文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這已經超過燈塔系統的運算閾值了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判庭文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖徒閣下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，往前看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海與天的交界處，那些濃重的色塊都是海嗣的浪潮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風聲在變小……此時此刻，估算它們的數量和範圍已經沒有意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"經驗比數據有用，我曾經親眼見過這樣的海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判庭文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說……大、大靜謐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來的事情，交給懲戒軍和審判官們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懲戒軍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"報、報告！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懲戒軍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"兩個大陣已經完成布防，阿戈爾的無人機矩陣正在協助我們調整防禦工事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判庭文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖徒閣下，海面上，浪湧起來了……有什麼在往上升……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判庭文員","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是……阿戈爾的城市？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"彌利亞留姆。捨棄了它的心臟之後，這座孤獨地遠航了萬千里程的阿戈爾城市正在緩緩升上海面。\n在城市單元骨架的支撐下，它的每一寸機體都在重組，無形的力場向著海底與天空延伸，直至化作高牆般的巨構。\n巨構破開海面，掀起百米高的巨浪，而在城市的另一面，真正的狂潮轉瞬即至——\n活著的海浪，形態各異的海嗣已經與海洋融為一體，海的子嗣即是海洋本身，它們甚至改變了海水的顏色。\n來自深海的城市與蠕行的狂潮正在同時舒展身軀，它們碰撞，相擁，然後盡情撕咬。\n自然從不力竭，而文明更不會在此刻卻步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1388_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"彌利亞留姆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"萬物靜寂，沒有風聲膽敢訴說此時的所見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
